    5. For each marker color, pick 2 distinct tile-row indices and 2 distinct tile-col indices (spans >= 1 each); ensure no row/col band overlap with other markers.
    6. Replace the 4 corner tile interiors with the marker color.
    7. Build output by painting marker color into bg cells along the 4 rectangle sides (horizontal and vertical bands between corners).
